      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>A precision variable-choke system controlled by a targeting VI that dynamically adjusts spread angle based on target range data fed from the weapon's sensors. At close range it widens for maximum coverage; at distance it tightens to near-rifle precision. The result is a shotgun that can perform effectively at ranges previously requiring a dedicated rifle. Designed for shotguns. Increases the weapon's range increment by 20 feet.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires a shotgun.</p>"
